<title>EGYPT: Egyptian share index rises to new record.</title>
<headline>Egyptian share index rises to new record.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Egyptian all-share index closed at a new high of 337.04 points on Monday, up more than two percent on Sunday's record of 330.01 points.</p>
<p>Volume was also higher at a heavy 90.87 million pounds ($26.7 million), the Capital Market Authority said.</p>
<p>The previous high was 324.83 points, set on January 8.</p>
<p>$1 = 3.40 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
